WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:02.300
- You're playing Wednesday.
- I am.

00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:04.600
- What did you like about
playing that character,

00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:06.310
other than you get to be
a little snotty teenager,

00:00:06.310 --> 00:00:07.143
I liked it.

00:00:07.143 --> 00:00:08.956
- Besides really my middle school years.

00:00:08.956 --> 00:00:10.730
What didn't I like?

00:00:10.730 --> 00:00:12.720
I was always the biggest
fan of the Addams Family.

00:00:12.720 --> 00:00:14.110
I grew up with the movie.

00:00:14.110 --> 00:00:15.630
That was always the big
one that I grew up with,

00:00:15.630 --> 00:00:19.140
and my mom would always show
me the reruns of the TV show,

00:00:19.140 --> 00:00:22.039
which was always a really
silly and fun thing to watch.

00:00:22.039 --> 00:00:24.050
But once I passed my middle school years,

00:00:24.050 --> 00:00:26.340
I really thought that
the ship had kinda sailed

00:00:26.340 --> 00:00:28.540
on me playing a middle schooler.

00:00:28.540 --> 00:00:30.940
But when this came
around, it was animation,

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:33.890
I finally had the luck of being
able to take a whack at it.

00:00:33.890 --> 00:00:36.060
And she was such a fun character

00:00:36.060 --> 00:00:38.700
to try and fill the shoes
of of so many people

00:00:38.700 --> 00:00:40.640
that have really killed
it, so I felt really lucky.

00:00:40.640 --> 00:00:42.400
- She seems sarcastic, I'm in.

00:00:42.400 --> 00:00:43.980
- She is, she's a little bit,

00:00:43.980 --> 00:00:48.350
I kind of played her off of
Hannibal Lecter a little bit.

00:00:48.350 --> 00:00:49.470
- [Kelly] Love.
- So she's a little bit

00:00:49.470 --> 00:00:51.537
of a serial killer vibe,

00:00:51.537 --> 00:00:52.370
but in a little girl's body.
- [Kelly] See now,

00:00:52.370 --> 00:00:53.203
I did watch that movie.

00:00:53.203 --> 00:00:54.036
- Oh, you saw

00:00:54.036 --> 00:00:55.050
"Silence of the Lambs?"
- That movie I'm okay with.

00:00:55.050 --> 00:00:56.508
Yeah, it's weird.

00:00:56.508 --> 00:00:57.341
I just want it to be.
- I don't know why

00:00:57.341 --> 00:00:58.360
you're okay with that one.

00:00:58.360 --> 00:00:59.400
- Yeah.
(audience laughing)

00:00:59.400 --> 00:01:00.960
It's sir Anthony Hopkins.

00:01:00.960 --> 00:01:02.420
- It's terrifying.
- It is,

00:01:02.420 --> 00:01:03.670
but somehow he made--
- When he's wearing

00:01:03.670 --> 00:01:06.020
the human skin coat
and he's like, "Hello."

00:01:06.020 --> 00:01:10.164
- I know, but wait, somehow
he made it charismatic.

00:01:10.164 --> 00:01:12.546
I don't know.
(audience laughing)

00:01:12.546 --> 00:01:14.400
- The cannibal?
- [Kelly] I know.

00:01:15.238 --> 00:01:16.307
- I'm just gonna say we might

00:01:16.307 --> 00:01:17.140
have some personal issues.
- I'm all weird.

00:01:17.140 --> 00:01:18.160
I know, I know I do.

00:01:18.160 --> 00:01:19.500
I probably do, I do.

00:01:19.500 --> 00:01:22.500
I thought, I don't know, I find
Anthony Hopkins charismatic.

